# Privacy Policy for Trash Hero: Sorting Expert

**Effective Date: September 29, 2026**

TheExploringDuck ("we," "us," or "our") operates the mobile game **Trash Hero: Sorting Expert**. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the game.

## Information We Collect

Trash Hero: Sorting Expert does not require users to create an account and does not intentionally collect personally identifiable information such as your name, email address, phone number, physical address, or precise location.

Game progress and settings may be stored locally on your device as necessary for the game to function.

## In-App Purchases

Trash Hero: Sorting Expert offers optional in-app purchases.

Purchases made through Google Play are processed by Google Play and its payment systems. TheExploringDuck does not directly collect or store payment-card numbers or other payment credentials provided to Google for processing purchases.

The game may receive information necessary to verify and fulfill a purchase, such as the purchased product, purchase status, transaction or purchase token, and related purchase information.

Google's handling of information associated with Google Play purchases is governed by Google's applicable terms and privacy policies.

## Third-Party Services

Trash Hero: Sorting Expert may rely on platform services provided by Google Play for distribution, in-app purchasing, and related functionality. These services may process technical, device, transaction, or other information according to their own privacy policies.

## Data Sharing

TheExploringDuck does not sell users' personal information.

Information may be processed by third-party platform providers when necessary to provide features such as in-app purchases or distribution of the game.

## Data Security

We take reasonable measures appropriate to the information handled by the game. Payment information used for in-app purchases is handled by the applicable payment platform rather than being directly stored by TheExploringDuck.

## Data Retention and Deletion

Trash Hero: Sorting Expert does not currently provide user accounts or maintain a developer-operated database containing personally identifiable user profiles.

Locally stored game data may generally be removed by clearing the application's data or uninstalling the game. Information processed independently by Google Play or another platform provider is subject to that provider's retention and deletion practices.

## Children's Privacy

Trash Hero: Sorting Expert does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information directly from children. If the game's target audience, features, or data practices change, this Privacy Policy will be updated as appropriate.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated if Trash Hero: Sorting Expert adds or changes features, services, third-party integrations, or data-handling practices. Changes will be reflected by updating the effective date of this policy.

## Contact

For questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or the privacy practices of Trash Hero: Sorting Expert, please contact TheExploringDuck through the developer contact information provided on the game's Google Play listing.

